---
import { Tv, Mail, Phone, MapPin, Send } from 'lucide-astro';
---
<footer class="bg-card border-t border-white/10 pt-16 pb-8" aria-label="Pie de página">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Brand Info -->
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6" aria-label="IPTV Costa Rica Inicio">
          <Tv class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" />
          <span class="font-bold text-xl text-white">IPTV Costa Rica</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-textSecondary text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          El servicio de streaming premium número uno de Costa Rica. Canales nacionales, deportes en vivo y entretenimiento sin límites.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm text-textSecondary">
          <a href="mailto:contact@iptvcostarica.live" class="flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="Correo de contacto"><Mail class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"/> contact@iptvcostarica.live</a>
          <a href="mailto:support@castvera.com" class="flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="Correo de soporte"><Mail class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"/> support@castvera.com</a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/18036582620" class="flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-white transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Teléfono WhatsApp"><Phone class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"/> +1 803 658 2620</a>
          <a href="https://t.me/castvera_com" class="flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-white transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Canal de Telegram"><Send class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"/> Canal de Telegram</a>
          <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VayVaLpD8SE3bf8wMY3v" class="flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-white transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Canal de WhatsApp"><Phone class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"/> Canal de WhatsApp</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links -->
      <nav aria-label="Enlaces Rápidos">
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-6">Enlaces Rápidos</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-textSecondary">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Inicio</a></li>
          <li><a href="/precios" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Planes y Precios</a></li>
          <li><a href="/canales" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Lista de Canales</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Guías y Blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="/referral" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Programa de Referidos</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Contacto</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <!-- Legal -->
      <nav aria-label="Legal y Ubicaciones">
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-6">Legal</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-textSecondary">
          <li><a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Política de Privacidad</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terms" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Términos de Servicio</a></li>
          <li><a href="/refund" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Política de Reembolso (24h)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/dmca" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">DMCA</a></li>
          <li><a href="/disclaimer" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Descargo de Responsabilidad</a></li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-4 mt-6">Ubicaciones Top</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-textSecondary flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <li><a href="/locations/san-jose" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors bg-white/5 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-white/5">San José</a></li>
          <li><a href="/locations/alajuela" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors bg-white/5 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-white/5">Alajuela</a></li>
          <li><a href="/locations/cartago" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors bg-white/5 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-white/5">Cartago</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <!-- Map and Address -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2"><MapPin class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"/> Sede Virtual</h3>
        <p class="text-textSecondary mb-4 text-sm flex items-start gap-2">
          <span>Avenida 2, Calle 1<br/>Edificio Metropolitano, Piso 4<br/>San José, Costa Rica, 10101</span>
        </p>
        <div class="w-full h-32 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <iframe 
            src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3930.123456789!2d-84.0795!3d9.9333!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x8fa0e360934fdf67%3A0xc638a164d96c9c86!2sSan%20Jos%C3%A9%2C%20Costa%20Rica!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1610000000000!5m2!1sen!2sus" 
            width="100%" 
            height="100%" 
            style="border:0;" 
            allowfullscreen="" 
            loading="lazy" 
            title="Mapa de ubicación en San José, Costa Rica"
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade">
          </iframe>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
    
    <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-xs text-textSecondary">
      <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} IPTV Costa Rica. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <p>Diseñado para una experiencia 100% Pura Vida.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
